 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_kms.c  |  2 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp4/mdp4_kms.c |  3 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp5/mdp5_kms.c |  3 +-
